### List genres
GET http://localhost:8080/api/genres

### List performers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers?page=0&size=20

### Search performers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers?search=aurora&page=0&size=20

### Get performer details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers/1

### List albums
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums?page=0&size=20

### Search albums
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums?search=electric&page=0&size=20

### List albums by performer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums?performerId=1&page=0&size=20

### Get album details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/albums/1

### List songs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs?page=0&size=20

### Search songs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs?search=love&page=0&size=20

### List songs by genre
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs?genreName=Pop&page=0&size=20

### List songs by performer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs?performerId=1&page=0&size=20

### List of recent releases
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs/recent?page=0&size=20

### Get song details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/songs/1

### Nested performer albums
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers/1/albums?page=0&size=20

### Nested performer songs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/performers/1/songs?page=0&size=20